    "detailed_description": "<br><br><strong>Heroes of Artadis</strong> is a turn-based PvP strategy game. Choose heroes for your squad, plan your tactics, and overthrow the enemy king!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2888380/extras/5010c642275f78c53a096ccc3a8fb323.webp?t=1744093477\" width=616 height=27 /></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2888380/extras/664dab9c9af6f0e770358eaa67aa201d.poster.avif?t=1744093477\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2888380/extras/664dab9c9af6f0e770358eaa67aa201d.webm?t=1744093477\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2888380/extras/664dab9c9af6f0e770358eaa67aa201d.mp4?t=1744093477\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Choose one of the civilizations of Artadis and build your dream team. Every hero brings unique skills into battle and all of them have their own important role: agile assassins, battle mages, bloodthirsty berserkers, and many more. Currently, over forty heroes from two factions are ready to fight for glory,  and every major update adds new characters to the game.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2888380/extras/ebdc1fd6e25d4e764c35b3b46c60bfe3.webp?t=1744093477\" width=616 height=27 /></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2888380/extras/1be4c13f88e9b449d0700e9db0df9363.poster.avif?t=1744093477\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2888380/extras/1be4c13f88e9b449d0700e9db0df9363.webm?t=1744093477\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2888380/extras/1be4c13f88e9b449d0700e9db0df9363.mp4?t=1744093477\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Think strategically and unlock your squad\u2019s potential in turn-based PvP battles. With each round, you\u2019ll have more opportunities to make your heroes stronger and outplay your opponent. Apply boosts, use magical abilities, and slay the enemy king!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2888380/extras/710c1a6e783f6caa5d212c596e18dcb3.webp?t=1744093477\" width=616 height=27 /></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2888380/extras/f3a18ebd9419d9d2fc1c0556128bf892.poster.avif?t=1744093477\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2888380/extras/f3a18ebd9419d9d2fc1c0556128bf892.webm?t=1744093477\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2888380/extras/f3a18ebd9419d9d2fc1c0556128bf892.mp4?t=1744093477\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Win battles in competitive mode to climb the ranks. Become Artadis\u2019s strongest general! Complete continuous challenges to add new heroes to your collection and expand your strategic options. Get to know each character\u2019s unique story and personality \u2013 they\u2019re more than just their skills and abilities!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2888380/extras/Gif_4.gif?t=1744093477\" width=600 height=338 /></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2888380/extras/49eff2cb182326faafd931cc07c5e7ab.webp?t=1744093477\" width=600 height=40 /></span>",
    "about_the_game": "<br><br><strong>Heroes of Artadis</strong> is a turn-based PvP strategy game. Choose heroes for your squad, plan your tactics, and overthrow the enemy king!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2888380/extras/5010c642275f78c53a096ccc3a8fb323.webp?t=1744093477\" width=616 height=27 /></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2888380/extras/664dab9c9af6f0e770358eaa67aa201d.poster.avif?t=1744093477\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2888380/extras/664dab9c9af6f0e770358eaa67aa201d.webm?t=1744093477\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2888380/extras/664dab9c9af6f0e770358eaa67aa201d.mp4?t=1744093477\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Choose one of the civilizations of Artadis and build your dream team. Every hero brings unique skills into battle and all of them have their own important role: agile assassins, battle mages, bloodthirsty berserkers, and many more. Currently, over forty heroes from two factions are ready to fight for glory,  and every major update adds new characters to the game.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2888380/extras/ebdc1fd6e25d4e764c35b3b46c60bfe3.webp?t=1744093477\" width=616 height=27 /></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2888380/extras/1be4c13f88e9b449d0700e9db0df9363.poster.avif?t=1744093477\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2888380/extras/1be4c13